Z||000005||turbo86se||07-28-2001||11:36 AM||||RFTH, I've always wanted to do that. I graduate this December, so my Fall semester is going to be heavy, so I doubt I'll be able to attend. <P>Songman, I know he told me where he was from, I just don't remember. The black GT was in real good shape except the paint was a little faded. I told him to get in touch with me if he ever wanted to sell it, he said she'd never sell it!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>I told him of Skitime's see-through decklid, that really got his attention. Wish I had some pics with me. <P>If I remember right, he said they also have a red '85GT with very low miles, around 25K.<P>Why is it I never see or meet any Fiero owners when I'm in my Fiero? I did follow a white '86GT a couple blocks in my SE. We pulled over and talked for a little while, he about fell over when I opened my decklid.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ||||reg||1
